## 📌 Summary Table

| Category | Binary Leading Bits | Decimal Range |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Class A** | `0.......` | `0 – 127` |
| **Class B** | `10......` | `128 – 191` |
| **Class C** | `110.....` | `192 – 223` |
| **Private A** | Network `10` | `10.0.0.0/8` |
| **Private B** | Second octet `00010000` to `00011111` | `172.16.0.0/12` |
| **Private C** | 256 Class C networks | `192.168.0.0/16` |

